### AETHWYRD — UPGRADE V6

### Crafting, Professions, Survival & Equipment Evolution

For V6, I recommend focusing on something completely different from V3, V4, and V5:

Build a complete crafting, gathering, resource, equipment, and profession ecosystem.

The idea is to make the world economically and mechanically interconnected. Players should be able to gather materials, discover recipes, manufacture equipment, build useful objects, specialize in professions, and create increasingly powerful items.

### The upgrade progression

| Version | Main focus                         |
| ------- | ---------------------------------- |
| V3      | Blender and 3D production          |
| V4      | Living world and dynamic narrative |
| V5      | Combat and enemy intelligence      |
| V6      | Crafting, professions and survival |

