### 1\. Advanced crafting system

Create a flexible crafting system supporting many item categories.

Craftable categories:

* Weapons.

* Armor.

* Shields.

* Jewelry.

* Potions.

* Food.

* Tools.

* Building materials.

* Accessories.

* Magical artifacts.

* Ammunition.

* Consumables.

Advanced crafting features:

* Recipe discovery.

* Material requirements.

* Crafting quality.

* Item rarity.

* Crafting difficulty.

* Failure and success chances.

* Critical crafting outcomes.

* Multiple crafting stations.

* Recipe experimentation.

* Custom item naming.

* Crafting experience.

* Specialization bonuses.

New idea: Crafting quality system

The same recipe could produce different results based on materials, player skill, station quality, and optional crafting bonuses.

For example:

* Poorly crafted iron sword.

* Standard iron sword.

* Reinforced iron sword.

* Mastercrafted iron sword.

* Legendary enchanted iron sword.

