### 15\. Master V6 development directive

# AETHWYRD — UPGRADE V6
## ADVANCED CRAFTING, PROFESSIONS, SURVIVAL & EQUIPMENT EXPANSION

### PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Expand Aethwyrd with a comprehensive item creation, crafting, gathering, profession, equipment customization, enchanting, survival, farming, and housing ecosystem.

This upgrade must focus on additions, expansions, and improvements. Preserve existing working systems.

### 1. PROJECT DISCOVERY

- Inspect the existing inventory and item architecture.
- Identify crafting, equipment, gathering, economy, and progression systems.
- Identify existing data structures and save formats.
- Reuse existing systems wherever possible.
- Document integration points.
- Create a staged implementation plan before major changes.

### 2. ITEM AND INVENTORY SYSTEM

Implement or expand:

- Central item database.
- Item categories.
- Rarity and quality.
- Item stacking.
- Item durability where appropriate.
- Item metadata.
- Storage containers.
- Equipment slots.
- Item comparison.
- Item descriptions.
- Item serialization and persistence.

### 3. CRAFTING SYSTEM

Implement:

- Data-driven recipes.
- Crafting stations.
- Material requirements.
- Recipe discovery.
- Crafting quality.
- Crafting difficulty.
- Success and failure outcomes.
- Recipe experimentation.
- Crafting experience.
- Batch crafting.
- Crafting history.

### 4. PROFESSIONS

